Package: poissonutils
Type: Package
Title: Poisson Distribution Tools for Count Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Sharone Vanelle", "Ndomtchi", email = "sharonevanelle@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Reusable tools to work with count data under the Poisson
    model: simple probabilities, estimation of the rate with an exact
    confidence interval, goodness-of-fit test, aggregation by period,
    ranking of risky zones, Poisson regression with exposure,
    overdispersion diagnostics, prediction, plotting, alerts and export.
    All functions work on any data.frame: the user supplies column names.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: ggplot2, rlang, stats, tools, utils
Suggests: readxl, testthat (>= 3.0.0), writexl
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
LazyData: true
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.1
